  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "V-ikOohTHFutEP43",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "**Background:** Born on Kestrel Station, an aging orbital refueling platform on the edge of inhabited space. Nadia has been fixing things since she was old enough to hold a wrench — first for her uncle's salvage shop, now as a certified spacecraft mechanic for whoever puts in at the docks. She dreams of a homestead on Aldanar Prime, a terraformed colony world, and has been squirreling away credits for the one-way passage for six years. Honest to a fault (a disadvantage in her line of work), curious about everything, and popular with the regulars at Grift's Tavern where she plays a battered acoustic guitar on sixth-day nights."
    }
  ],
